WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.443
- Hey, what's up, y'all.

00:00:01.443 --> 00:00:02.677
Thank you so much.
- What is good?

00:00:02.677 --> 00:00:05.850
- For doing this show, I
really, really appreciate it,

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:07.810
I know it's an awkward
thing, we tried to make it

00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:09.403
look like my show, like, and I love that--

00:00:09.403 --> 00:00:11.082
- Is that not a real background,

00:00:11.082 --> 00:00:12.730
is that like a virtual background?

00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:16.010
- No dude, this is my formal
living room and it's gone

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:19.240
and they literally put
a whole setup behind me.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:20.480
- That looks so cool.
- That's crazy.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:21.810
- Donald, are you in a closet?

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:23.040
- I am in my closet.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.090
This is where I escape reality.

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:27.820
I escape the wife, I escape the kids

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:29.870
and this is also where we do the podcast.

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:33.250
- It is funny in this
pandemic time to find,

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:35.250
especially we were in a cabin in Montana,

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:37.170
now I'm in LA, but we were
in a cabin in Montana,

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:39.170
it's so small, and there's
like nowhere to go,

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:41.374
and literally would end up in a bathroom.

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:43.407
And I'm like, "This is
weird, this is weird,

00:00:43.407 --> 00:00:45.970
"that I'm in a bathroom."
- Kelly, we started recording

00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:48.420
the podcast then Donald
needed to find a place

00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:51.520
that was good for sound, and
so he started with his closet

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:53.450
and then he realized that his kids

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:54.890
didn't wanna come in there

00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:56.270
and his wife would leave him alone

00:00:56.270 --> 00:00:57.740
and so now I think his whole family

00:00:57.740 --> 00:00:59.905
thinks he makes the podcast like everyday.

00:00:59.905 --> 00:01:01.490
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:03.780
- He's just sitting in
there doing crosswords.

00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:05.430
- Absolutely.
- Absolutely.

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:07.906
- Absolutely, sometimes I doodle.

00:01:07.906 --> 00:01:09.069
(all laughing)

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:10.069
- Oh my God.

